@startuml
[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state WaitingForChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Correct PIN / Display Options

WaitingForChoice --> Confiscating : Cancel Operation / Keep Card Secure
Confiscating --> Ejecting : User Cancels / Return Card

Ejecting --> [*] : End

@enduml
